  "project_description": "Introduction \n Recommended modules \n Installation \n Configuration \n Maintainers \n \n Back to top \n\n Introduction \n Izi Message is a very simple module that provides Drupal messages.\n\nThis module elegant, responsive, flexible and light.\n\n \n Browser compatibility \n \n\n Back to top \n\n Recommended modules \n \n No extra module is required. \n \n Back to top \n\n Installation \n \n Install as usual, see Installing Modules for further information. \n \n Back to top \n\n Configuration \n \n Navigate to Administration > Configuration > Development >\n\n Izi message settings for configurations. Save Configurations.\n \n \n Back to top \n\n Requirements \n This module requires no modules outside of Drupal core,\n\nbut require next js library:\n\n \n iziToast \n \n \n Similar Modules: \n \n Better Messages \n Status Messages \n \n Back to top",
